        ... ...

        tradeParams.vaultId = globalData.createOrGetVault(tradeParams.vaultId, tradeParams.pairId);

278:    return TradeLogic.trade(globalData, tradeParams, settlementData);
    }
```
TradeLogic.sol#trade():
```solidity
