    ) external returns (IPredyPool.TradeResult memory tradeResult) {
        DataType.PairStatus storage pairStatus = globalData.pairs[tradeParams.pairId];

        ... ...
42:     tradeResult = Trade.trade(globalData, tradeParams, settlementData);
        ... ...        

        // The caller deposits or withdraws margin from the callback that is called below.
52:     callTradeAfterCallback(globalData, tradeParams, tradeResult);

        ... ...
    }
```
TradeLogic.sol#callTradeAfterCallback():
```solidity
    function callTradeAfterCallback(
        GlobalDataLibrary.GlobalData storage globalData,
        IPredyPool.TradeParams memory tradeParams,
        IPredyPool.TradeResult memory tradeResult
    ) internal {
73:     globalData.initializeLock(tradeParams.pairId);

        ... ...
