In particular, the `PredyPool.sol#trade()` function
This is the core feature of `Predy` for gas-free trading with our fully on-chain, vault-free Intent-based DEX for Perpetuals and Gamma.
As a result, the core function of `Predy` is damaged due to incorrect implementation of the `GlobalData.sol#initializeLock()` function.

