## Impact
The Fillers are responsible for executing the Trader's order, however if there is no exchange route that will yield some benefits for the fillers they might not be incentivesed to execute the order. In the documentation it is not mentioned that the Filler is a trusted position, so I would assume that if there is no incentive/penalty they will not behave as expected. 

## Proof of Concept
Consider the following scenario:

1) Trader wants to open a position, submits an order for execution. 
2) A filler sees his order pending but there is no trade that would incentivise him to submit the order in a transaction. 
3) Trader's position sits waiting until a profitable trade is open.

https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-05-predy/blob/a9246db5f874a91fb71c296aac6a66902289306a/src/markets/perp/PerpMarketV1.sol#L149
