The current [getSqrtPrice()](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-05-predy/blob/a9246db5f874a91fb71c296aac6a66902289306a/src/PriceFeed.sol#L45-L58) does not check if the L2 Sequencer is down before returning the price:
